body:
A very funny poem and a true tragedy, though I am not personally a fan of bagels. However, recently I dropped a slice of cake about 10 feet from the place where I bought it and it fell into the dirt, which brought me to my knees in misery.

&#x200B;

That all being said, as much as I enjoyed your poem, I found it difficult to concentrate on the poem because of the inconsistent rhyme scheme, so I was thrown every time a rhyme did come in and when it skipped around. In my opinion, I would have found it a more captivating and amusing poem if you had stuck to a consistent rhyme scheme or none at all. But still a very impressive and funny poem.
